This decorator turns a generator into a context manager. You write setup code, yield the resource, and put cleanup in a finally block so it always runs:

@contextmanager
def timer(label):
    start = time.time()
    try:
        yield
    finally:
        print(label, time.time() - start)

It is much shorter than a class and is the go-to for simple resource or instrumentation wrappers.

